6-07-12\",\"startsAt\":\"2026-07-12T20:50:00+01:00\",\"endsAt\":\"2026-07-12T22:57:00+01:00\",\"filmStartsAt\":\"2026-07-12T21:11:00+01:00\",\"filmEndsAt\":\"2026-07-12T22:57:00+01:00\",\"inSeatItemDelivery\":null},\"isSoldOut\":false,\"seatLayoutId\":\"CAM1-2-7\",\"filmId\":\"HO00007147\",\"siteId\":\"CAM1\",\"screenId\":\"CAM1-2\",\"areaCategories\":[{\"areaCategoryId\":\"CAM1-0000000002\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true}],\"attributeIds\":[],\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"requires3dGlasses\":false,\"eventId\":null,\"restrictions\":[],\"filmAdvanceBookingRuleId\":null}],\"relatedData\":{\"sites\":[{\"id\":\"CAM1\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Camden\",\"translations\":[]},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.5423011779785,\"longitude\":-0.143399998545647},\"contactDetails\":{\"phoneNumbers\":[],\"email\":\"CAM1@curzon.com\",\"address\":{\"line1\":\"Dockray Place,\",\"line2\":\"London,\",\"city\":\"NW1 8QD\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\",\"hasSellableItems\":false,\"allowedItemDeliveryMethods\":[]}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00006825\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Toy Story 5\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The toys are back in Disney and Pixar’s “Toy Story 5,” and this time around it’s Toy meets Tech. Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang’s jobs get exponentially harder when they go head to head with this all-new threat to playtime.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The toys are back in Disney and Pixar’s “Toy Story 5,” and this time around it’s Toy meets Tech. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":102,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/3e6d64d4-c466-4c58-93cd-ce8d7c41f210/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GM3Dmn06fy8\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GM3Dmn06fy8\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002191\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003325\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005692\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006291\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009763\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013297\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013298\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013314\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013315\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013316\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002191\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003325\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005692\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006291\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009763\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013314\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013297\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013315\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013298\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013316\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000003\",\"0000000007\",\"0000000025\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"3e6d64d4-c466-4c58-93cd-ce8d7c41f210\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006825\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008421\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006852\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Project Hail Mary\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Science teacher Ryland Grace (Ryan Gosling) wakes up on a spaceship light years from home with no recollection of who he is or how he got there. As his memory returns, he begins to uncover his mission: solve the riddle of the mysterious substance causing the sun to die out. He must call on his scientific knowledge and unorthodox ideas to save everything on Earth from extinction… but an unexpected friendship means he may not have to do it alone.\\n\\nCUSTOMER NOTICE: Contains a sequence of flashing lights which might affect customers who are susceptible to photosensitive epilepsy.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Science teacher Ryland Grace (Ryan Gosling) wakes up on a spaceship light years from home with no recollection of who he is or how he got there.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-20\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":156,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/b5e73a92-33c7-439c-b1d5-e8b523c75cfc/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3wGFc00i-C0\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3wGFc00i-C0\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000782\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000865\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001708\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002684\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002685\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004996\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005646\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008295\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013430\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013431\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013432\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000782\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000865\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005646\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013430\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013431\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002684\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002685\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001708\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002684\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002685\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004996\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005646\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008295\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013432\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000035\",\"0000000036\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"b5e73a92-33c7-439c-b1d5-e8b523c75cfc\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006852\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008449\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Sony Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006931\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Disclosure Day\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"If you found out we weren’t alone, if someone showed you, proved it to you, would that frighten you? This June, the truth belongs to seven billion people.\\n\\nWe are coming close to … Disclosure Day.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"If you found out we weren’t alone, if someone showed you, proved it to you, would that frighten you? This June, the truth belongs to seven billion people.\\n\\nWe are coming.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-10\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":145,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/920be864-1bc7-4cfd-aa64-b828b3c90b38/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pFz8czbdPdU\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pFz8czbdPdU\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000341\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001072\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002139\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008293\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013627\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000341\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000418\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001072\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008293\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013627\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002139\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000035\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"920be864-1bc7-4cfd-aa64-b828b3c90b38\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006931\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008544\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007012\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Moana\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In Disney’s live-action adaptation of the beloved Oscar®-nominated animated adventure, Moana (Catherine Lagaʻaia) answers the Ocean’s call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with the infamous demigod Maui (Dwayne Johnson) on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people. The film is directed by Emmy® and Tony Award® winner Thomas Kail (“Hamilton”); produced by Dwayne Johnson, Dany Garcia, Beau Flynn, Hiram Garcia and Lin-Manuel Miranda; and executive produced by Thomas Kail, Scott Sheldon, Charles Newirth and Auliʻi Cravalho, who voiced Moana in the animated features “Moana” and “Moana 2.”\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In Disney’s live-action adaptation of the beloved Oscar®-nominated animated adventure, Moana (Catherine Lagaʻaia) answers the Ocean’s call and, for the first time, voyage\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-10\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":120,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/a7437e11-b6d4-476f-89ac-5a3a2ee813c8/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JnficPHHF2U\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JnficPHHF2U\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000371\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001009\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001016\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001017\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001018\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011016\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011017\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011018\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011019\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001009\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007576\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011016\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011017\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011018\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011019\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000371\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001009\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001016\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001017\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001018\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000003\",\"0000000007\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a7437e11-b6d4-476f-89ac-5a3a2ee813c8\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007012\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008640\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007106\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Film Club: Far From the Madding Crowd\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"To mark the centenary of Academy Award-winning director John Schlesinger's birth, we're inviting you to experience his greatest films on the big screen. Season curated by Claire Nicolas and Marc David Jacobs. \\n\\nFAR FROM THE MADDING CROWD\\nBased on Thomas Hardy's renowned novel, this British drama focuses on Bathsheba Everdene (Julie Christie), a beautiful young woman who inherits a picturesque farm from her uncle and is determined to run it herself. Three very different suitors -- Francis Troy (Terence Stamp), an intense soldier; William Boldwood (Peter Finch), a middle-aged farmer; and Gabriel Oak (Alan Bates), a shepherd of modest means -- all contend for Bathsheba's hand, and conflict is inevitable.\\n\\nSoho screens the film from 35mm. \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A beautiful young woman inherits a picturesque farm from her uncle and is determined to run it herself. Three suitors contest for her hand.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-05\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":165,\"trailers\":[],\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001791\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010264\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010274\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011662\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013864\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001791\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010264\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010274\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013864\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011662\"}],\"producers\":[],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007106\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008753\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Park Circus\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007147\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Invite\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Joe and Angela’s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic \\nupstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. \\nHave they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down?\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Joe and Angela’s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic \\nupstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very strong language, strong sex references, drug misuse\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-03\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":106,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/ad147b9a-b731-410f-8bf9-c4f3f3df2095/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jnLW-q2ftKA\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jnLW-q2ftKA\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001093\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002460\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003915\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004392\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004710\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007157\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013073\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014130\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002460\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003915\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004392\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004710\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003915\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001093\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007157\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013073\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014130\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"ad147b9a-b731-410f-8bf9-c4f3f3df2095\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007147\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008799\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Black Bear\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007148\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Fresh off the worldwide blockbuster success of summer 2024’s funniest comedy, Despicable Me 4, Illumination expands its joyful animated universe with a riotous new chapter, featuring all-new characters, in the biggest global animated franchise in history: Minions & Monsters.\\n\\nThis is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\\n\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Fresh off the worldwide blockbuster success of summer 2024’s funniest comedy, Despicable Me 4, Illumination expands its joyful animated universe \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-01\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":90,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/c8c91209-628b-4589-b74f-6d189c4af903/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rwUCM8fuP2U\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rwUCM8fuP2U\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001390\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002569\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002634\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005384\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006676\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008674\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008697\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013335\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014131\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014132\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014133\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001390\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002634\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005384\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006676\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008674\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008697\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013335\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014131\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014132\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008697\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002569\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014133\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000003\",\"0000000025\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"c8c91209-628b-4589-b74f-6d189c4af903\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007148\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008800\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007150\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Evil Dead Burn\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Evil Dead Burn unleashes the franchise’s most savage and terrifying ride to date, blazing onto big screens with an all-new chapter of carnage and demonic mayhem. After the loss of her husband, a woman seeks solace with her in-laws in their secluded family home. As one by one they are transformed into Deadites—turning the gathering into a family reunion from hell—she comes to discover that the vows she took in life... live on even in death.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Evil Dead Burn unleashes the franchise’s most savage and terrifying ride to date, blazing onto big screens with an all-new chapter of carnage and demonic mayhem. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong bloody violence, gore\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":109,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/c9c67d5b-8833-464f-9feb-ed29fa1c8db9/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YYkUkyfjUKg\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YYkUkyfjUKg\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMember