orld-famous, Monday-hating, lasagna-loving indoor cat, is about to have a wild outdoor adventure! After an unexpected reunion with his long-lost father – scruffy street cat Vic (voiced by Samuel L. Jackson) – Garfield and his canine friend Odie are forced from their perfectly pampered life into joining Vic in a hilarious, high-stakes heist.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Garfield (voiced by Chris Pratt), the world-famous, Monday-hating, lasagna-loving indoor cat, is about to have a wild outdoor adventure!\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very mild threat, violence, language, rude humour\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-17\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":101,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pf1665nJZ48\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pf1665nJZ48\",\"displayPriority\":7,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000125\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003139\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004495\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004896\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005592\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005717\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007381\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007858\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008504\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008505\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008506\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008507\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008508\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008509\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008510\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008511\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008512\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008513\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000125\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003139\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004495\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004896\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005592\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005717\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007381\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008504\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008505\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008506\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007858\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008507\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008508\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008509\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008510\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008511\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008512\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008513\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000003\",\"0000000007\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00005421\",\"hoCode\":\"A000006713\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Park Circus\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007105\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Film Club: Midnight Cowboy\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"To mark the centenary of Academy Award-winning director John Schlesinger's birth, we're inviting you to experience his greatest films on the big screen. Season curated by Claire Nicolas and Marc David Jacobs. \\n\\nMIDNIGHT COWBOY\\nA naive hustler travels from Texas to New York City to seek personal fortune but, in the process, finds himself a new friend.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A naive hustler travels from Texas to New York City to seek personal fortune but, in the process, finds himself a new friend.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"Sexual violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-05\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":111,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qI-KezdGj0E\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qI-KezdGj0E\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008227\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009665\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011662\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000726\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000727\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000728\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000729\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000730\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000731\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008227\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009665\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000726\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000727\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000728\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000729\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000730\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011662\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000731\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007105\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008752\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Park Circus\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007116\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Odyssey\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Legendary filmmaker Christopher Nolan follows up his Oscar-winning sensation Oppenheimer with another rousing epic, The Odyssey, whose all-star cast includes Matt Damon, Tom Holland, Anne Hathaway, Robert Pattinson, Lupita Nyong'o, Zendaya and Charlize Theron.\\n\\nThis mythic action movie recounts the story of Odysseus (Damon) on his perilous journey home, troubled by gods and monsters. Meanwhile, his wife Penelope (Hathaway) and son Telemachus (Holland) fight to hold their kingdom together against relentless suitors.\\n\\nSee it on 35mm film at Soho, and enjoy it with Dolby Atmos sound at Bloomsbury, Canterbury Riverside and Kingston.\\n\\nTHE ODYSSEY MIDNIGHT SCREENINGS\\nThe film will start promptly at 12:01am on Thursday night. Please ensure you are seated by midnight.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Christopher Nolan’s next film, The Odyssey, is a mythic action epic shot across the world using brand new IMAX® film technology. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-17\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":172,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/b3ff6b75-3025-43b7-88a5-37fc8c43d313/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sk6LZrA2JSQ\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sk6LZrA2JSQ\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000319\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000680\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001061\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002220\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002609\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003850\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004443\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005731\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014094\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000319\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000680\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001061\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002220\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002609\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003850\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004443\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005731\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005731\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014094